Severity: ERROR
Category: tigris
Check: config tiger tigris
Fix: Name the kind of scan in letters, digits, dot, dash and underscore, a letter or a digit first, 64 characters at most: tigris --identity nightly.
References: tigris(8)

--identity was given a name that is not one, or Tigris_Identity in the
tigris.conf or the profile is not: a scan identity is letters, digits,
dot, dash and underscore, a letter or a digit first, 64 characters at
most (nightly, pre-deploy). The run stops before it starts: the
identity goes into the JSON run record, where whoever collects the
reports may build a file name from it.
